# $var1$var2 -> "$var1$var2" (merged)
# text$var -> text"$var"  (text+var: text prefix, var quoted)
# But: $var$other -> "$var$other" (merged)
# echo $var1 $var2 -> echo "$var1" "$var2" (space-separated = not merged)

# The challenge: I currently parse $var1 and $var2 as separate UVar tokens.
